# ============================================================================
# .gitignore  -  AF293 DIA proteomics project (3v3 Lactate vs Saline)
# Tracked: code (scripts/, env/), config/, processed input (data/*.tsv),
#          annotation/ reference tables, README.
# Ignored: macOS litter, raw MS data, sensitive/administrative documents,
#          manuscript drafts, secrets, and all REGENERATABLE pipeline outputs
#          (rebuilt by `bash scripts/run_all.sh`). Each output dir keeps a
#          .gitkeep so the folder structure survives a clean clone.
# ============================================================================

# ---- macOS litter ----------------------------------------------------------
._*
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.TemporaryItems
.DocumentRevisions-V100
.VolumeIcon.icns

# ---- R / editor litter -----------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rapp.history
Rplots.pdf
*~
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---- Office / LaTeX temporary files ----------------------------------------
~$*
*.aux
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.out
*.toc

# ---- manuscript drafts (kept local, not part of the code repo) -------------
panel_Lactate_vs_Saline__methods_legends_results.*

# ---- raw MS data (deposit in PRIDE/MassIVE, not git) -----------------------
data/Raws/
*.raw
*.RAW
*.wiff
*.wiff.scan
*.d/
*.mzML
*.mzXML
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# ---- sensitive / administrative documents ----------------------------------
*Quotation*
*quotation*
*invoice*
*Invoice*
*orcamento*
*Orcamento*

# ---- secrets / credentials (none present; guard against future leaks) ------
.env
.env.*
.Renviron
.httr-oauth
.netrc
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secret*
*token*

# ---- generated pipeline outputs (regenerate with run_all.sh) ---------------
results/*
figures/*
objects/*
logs/*
!**/.gitkeep
Fragpipe_results
# ---- caches (re-downloaded; need internet) ---------------------------------
cache/
afm*.xml
*.xml

# ---- keep: the exact design sheet (small, documents what was run) ----------
!config/samples.tsv
